      "rationale": "Plant automaton models robot's perception and motion, allowing all sensor and motion events. Each state represents a unique obstacle configuration. All events are included and transitions are deterministic. Controllable actions are enabled one-at-a-time per state, except for obs_front where both move_backward and full_rotate are possible.",
